#: src/cli/CommandsForm.cpp:409
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Note: the field is written back with the standard border, background and "
"font. What its author set beyond its name, place, flags, choices and value "
"cannot be read out of the document, so give --colour, --background, --border-"
